quote:
let us go round. Not one of your cases,
     Watson--mental, not physical. All right; come if you want to. Now,
     Mr. Soames--at your disposal!

I am not very clear yet who you are or what you are;
     but youve said enough to make it very clear that we shall want you
     at the Yard.

It wont be so damn fine
     if I have to trim you up a bit. Ive handled your kind before now,
     and they didnt look fine when I was through with them.
